{
  "_comment": "Maps this program's six main lifts to exercise names as they appear in a Hevy log. Matching is case-insensitive substring on the normalized exercise title. Edit to match your own exercise names; run tools/analyze_history.py --list-exercises to see them. Optional key \"_exclude\": {lift: [substrings]} removes exercises whose name contains any of them (e.g. keep 'romanian deadlift' out of the deadlift track). Optional \"_variants\": {lift: {variant name: [substrings]}} lists exercises that count as that lift's exposure with their own load (row and pull-up; checked in order, only when the main exercise is absent). Optional \"_substitutes\": {lift: {match, exclude}} lists stand-ins for squat, bench, deadlift and press that are recorded for the gap clock but never change the track (templates/progression-tracks.md section 9).",
